      "description": "The meme is designed to target individuals who hold Islamophobic views or are familiar with stereotypes associating Muslim groups with terrorism or criminality. The intended audience likely includes people who are either unaware of the Muslim Brotherhood's political nature or who are predisposed to fear or distrust Muslim organizations. The meme uses the 'hacker bro' stereotype to provoke fear or hostility toward Muslims or the Muslim Brotherhood, making it particularly effective in communities that already harbor Islamophobic sentiments or are influenced by conspiracy theories linking Muslim groups to cybercrime or terrorism.",
